{
  "summary": "The change implements issue #2129: a new [GeneratedMessagePackFormatter] attribute lets the source generator write a formatter body into a user-declared partial class for a type in another assembly, with optional surrogate-based key/membership control, four new analyzer diagnostics (MsgPack019-MsgPack022), generator wiring, template and doc updates, and new tests. The solution builds, but the full suite fails: GeneratedMessagePackFormatterTests.FormatterMustImplementFormatterOfT fails because a formatter class with no IMessagePackFormatter<T> makes the generator crash with CS8785 instead of reporting MsgPack020. In GeneratedFormatterCollector.Collect the check `if (formatterInterfaces.Length > 1)` lets the zero-interface case fall through to `formatterInterfaces[0]`, which throws. The end-to-end execution tests for external types were not run, so the feature itself cannot be confirmed from the given evidence.",
  "requirement_verdicts": [
    {
      "req": "REQ-2129-F1",
      "verdict": "cannot_determine",
      "confidence_basis": "The feature code is present and the build passes, but the MsgPack020 diagnostic path crashes the generator (test failure) and the external-type execution tests were not run, so the requirement cannot be confirmed met.",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "requirement", "req": "REQ-2129-F1", "quote": "Feature Request: Allow generation of Formatter for a type in a referenced assembly"},
        {"kind": "code", "file": "src/MessagePack.Annotations/Attributes.cs", "line": 166, "rev": "head", "quote": "public class GeneratedMessagePackFormatterAttribute : Attribute"},
        {"kind": "code", "file": "src/MessagePack.SourceGenerator/CodeAnalysis/GeneratedFormatterCollector.cs", "line": 34, "rev": "head", "quote": "internal static FullModel? Collect("},
        {"kind": "code", "file": "src/MessagePack.SourceGenerator/MessagePackGenerator.cs", "line": 29, "rev": "head", "quote": "var generatedFormatters = context.SyntaxProvider.ForAttributeWithMetadataName("},
        {"kind": "check", "id": "build", "status": "pass"},
        {"kind": "test", "name": "GeneratedMessagePackFormatterTests.FormatterMustImplementFormatterOfT", "outcome": "failed"}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "N1",
      "title": "Formatter without IMessagePackFormatter<T> crashes the generator instead of reporting MsgPack020",
      "severity": "blocker",
      "category": "correctness",
      "claim": "GeneratedFormatterCollector.Collect only reports MsgPack020 when more than one IMessagePackFormatter<T> interface is implemented (`if (formatterInterfaces.Length > 1)`). With zero interfaces it falls through to `formatterInterfaces[0].TypeArguments[0]`, which throws on the empty array and fails the generator (observed as warning CS8785: Generator 'MessagePackGenerator' failed to generate source), so the documented diagnostic is never produced. This is exactly the failure in GeneratedMessagePackFormatterTests.FormatterMustImplementFormatterOfT, which failed in both the targeted run and the full suite.",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "code", "file": "src/MessagePack.SourceGenerator/CodeAnalysis/GeneratedFormatterCollector.cs", "line": 57, "rev": "head", "quote": "if (formatterInterfaces.Length > 1)"},
        {"kind": "code", "file": "src/MessagePack.SourceGenerator/CodeAnalysis/GeneratedFormatterCollector.cs", "line": 63, "rev": "head", "quote": "ITypeSymbol dataTypeSymbol = formatterInterfaces[0].TypeArguments[0];"},
        {"kind": "test", "name": "GeneratedMessagePackFormatterTests.FormatterMustImplementFormatterOfT", "outcome": "failed"},
        {"kind": "check", "id": "tests.full_suite", "status": "fail"},
        {"kind": "check", "id": "tests.targeted", "status": "fail"}
      ],
      "suggested_fix": "Change `if (formatterInterfaces.Length > 1)` to `if (formatterInterfaces.Length != 1)` so a formatter with zero IMessagePackFormatter<T> interfaces reports MsgPack020 and returns null instead of indexing an empty array."
    }
  ],
  "refusals": [
    {
      "topic": "End-to-end behavior of generated formatters for external types (round-trip serialization, surrogate keys, resolver registration)",
      "reason": "The tests/MessagePack.SourceGenerator.ExecutionTests project and its new tests (GeneratedFormatterForExternalTypesTests) are not among the facts.json checks, so no pass/fail evidence exists for the core feature; tests.fail_without_fix was also not run.",
      "who_should_decide": "area owner / maintainer (run the execution tests before merge)",
      "req": "REQ-2129-F1",
      "blocking": true
    },
    {
      "topic": "Contents of the two generated template outputs (FormatterTemplate.cs, StringKeyFormatterTemplate.cs)",
      "reason": "Only the .tt templates were provided; the generated .cs files' contents and diffs were not given, so the exact generated code text could not be verified.",
      "who_should_decide": "area owner",
      "blocking": false
    },
    {
      "topic": "Public API surface and analyzer rule checks",
      "reason": "The public_api and analyzers checks were not run for this revision.",
      "who_should_decide": "area owner",
      "blocking": false
    }
  ],
  "refutations": []
}
